{
  "name": "Document Ingestion Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📥 Document Ingestion Pipeline\nGoogle Drive (.md files) → chunk by Markdown heading → embed with OpenAI →\nupsert into Qdrant Cloud.\n\nConfig is read from `{{ $env.X }}`: `GDRIVE_FOLDER_ID`, `QDRANT_URL`,\n`QDRANT_COLLECTION`, `QDRANT_API_KEY`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`.\n\nSet this workflow's **Error Workflow** to \"Error Handler\" under Workflow → Settings.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "56f68acf-880f-4515-8a2b-521be1e5420c",
      "name": "Overview",
